Census complete. Full evidence below.

## 1. Universe of Vitest test files — 16 total

`find` over the repo (excluding `node_modules`) for `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx` returned 16 files, all under `overrides/`. **No `*.spec.ts`/`*.spec.tsx` exists under `overrides/`.** The only `*.spec.*` in the repo is `/Users/marcel.a.n.navarro/Dev/zimmermann-pwa/e2e/tests/zimm/homepage/SMOKE-homepage-load.spec.js` (Playwright, outside `vitest.config.ts`'s `include: ['overrides/**/*.test.ts', 'overrides/**/*.test.tsx']`).

`vitest.config.ts` sets **no** global `clearMocks` / `mockReset` / `restoreMocks`, and `vitest.setup.ts` is one line (`import '@testing-library/jest-dom';`) — so every reset is per-file and explicit.

